{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-beta-function.md","title":"Gödel's β-Function","display":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-godel-beta","display":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function","aliases":["57-df-godel-beta","57-df-β"],"depends_on":["[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-projection-function]]","[[90-df-addition-function]]","[[90-df-multiplication-function]]","[[90-df-divrem-function]]","[[90-df-factorial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-godel-beta"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-godel-beta</span><span>57-df-β</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" href=\"?note=88d284a5e496e4ef\" title=\"90-df-multiplication-function\">90-df-multiplication-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"46caa19bb1e0ac82\" href=\"?note=46caa19bb1e0ac82\" title=\"90-df-factorial-function\">90-df-factorial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-beta-function-—-Gödel's-β-Function-$\\beta$\">df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{add} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (加法函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (乘法函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" href=\"?note=88d284a5e496e4ef\" title=\"90-df-multiplication-function\">90-df-multiplication-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{div} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{div} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (除法函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rem} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{rem} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (余数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact} : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{fact} : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (阶乘函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"46caa19bb1e0ac82\" href=\"?note=46caa19bb1e0ac82\" title=\"90-df-factorial-function\">90-df-factorial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n : \\mathbb{N}^n \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\pi_i^n : \\mathbb{N}^n \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (投影函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(s \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (固定参数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\beta(a, i) = \\mathrm{rem}\\!\\left(a, 1 + \\mathrm{mul}(i+1, \\mathrm{div}(a, \\mathrm{fact}(s)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\beta(a, i) = \\mathrm{rem}\\!\\left(a, 1 + \\mathrm{mul}(i+1, \\mathrm{div}(a, \\mathrm{fact}(s)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\forall a, i \\in \\mathbb{N}\\; \\bigl( \\beta(a, i) = a \\bmod (1 + (i+1) \\cdot \\lfloor a / s! \\rfloor) \\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\forall a, i \\in \\mathbb{N}\\; \\bigl( \\beta(a, i) = a \\bmod (1 + (i+1) \\cdot \\lfloor a / s! \\rfloor) \\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\beta \\in \\mathrm{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta} \\vdash \\beta \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>-函数：用于编码有穷序列（Gödel 编码技术）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(a, i)\">\\(\\beta(a, i)\\)</span> 提取序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个元素</li>\n<li>组成函数均为原始递归：\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add}, \\mathrm{mul} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{add}, \\mathrm{mul} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{div}, \\mathrm{rem} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{div}, \\mathrm{rem} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" href=\"?note=f0ea0e26dd8bcf09\" title=\"90-df-divrem-function\">90-df-divrem-function</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{fact} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>由复合算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> 构造，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\beta \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=